WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.769 --> 00:00:12.553
"Mom!" Harry said.

2
00:00:12.554 --> 00:00:15.611
"Sanjay's birthday party is at Fun Zone!

3
00:00:15.612 --> 00:00:17.908
Can I go?"

4
00:00:17.909 --> 00:00:21.548
"Sure," Mom said.

5
00:00:21.549 --> 00:00:25.304
Harry thought about his own birthday party.

6
00:00:25.305 --> 00:00:28.272
He was having it in the backyard.

7
00:00:28.273 --> 00:00:30.470
Harry sighed.

8
00:00:30.471 --> 00:00:35.937
"I wish my party was at Fun Zone."

9
00:00:35.938 --> 00:00:39.630
"Fun Zone is expensive," Mom said.

10
00:00:39.631 --> 00:00:42.582
"You'll have a fun party here."

11
00:00:42.583 --> 00:00:45.624
Harry shrugged.

12
00:00:45.625 --> 00:00:49.594
Mom drove Harry to Sanjay's party.

13
00:00:49.595 --> 00:00:52.625
Fun Zone looked awesome.

14
00:00:52.626 --> 00:00:56.297
"This will be great," Harry said.

15
00:00:56.298 --> 00:01:00.867
"Let's play laser tag!" Sanjay said.

16
00:01:00.868 --> 00:01:04.103
Everyone put on vests.

17
00:01:04.104 --> 00:01:07.633
They grabbed plastic laser guns.

18
00:01:07.634 --> 00:01:10.460
Then they entered a dark room.

19
00:01:10.461 --> 00:01:14.090
Harry shot a laser at Finn.

20
00:01:14.091 --> 00:01:17.709
Finn's vest didn't beep.

21
00:01:17.710 --> 00:01:20.907
Sanjay shot at Harry.

22
00:01:20.908 --> 00:01:28.583
"My laser gun doesn't work!" Sanjay said.

23
00:01:28.584 --> 00:01:34.275
"Mine doesn't work either!" Jackson said.

24
00:01:34.276 --> 00:01:37.061
"Huh," a worker said.

25
00:01:37.062 --> 00:01:39.934
"The equipment is broken."

26
00:01:39.935 --> 00:01:44.845
"That stinks," Sanjay said.

27
00:01:44.846 --> 00:01:50.137
The friends went into the arcade.

28
00:01:50.138 --> 00:01:53.975
"They have Dino Hunter!" Harry said.

29
00:01:53.976 --> 00:01:56.594
Everyone hurried to the game.

30
00:01:56.595 --> 00:01:59.745
A sign was stuck to the machine.

31
00:01:59.746 --> 00:02:02.709
It read Out of Order.

32
00:02:02.710 --> 00:02:07.735
Sanjay groaned.

33
00:02:07.736 --> 00:02:13.576
"Let's play Skee-Ball," Finn said.

34
00:02:13.577 --> 00:02:17.176
Sanjay rolled a ball.

35
00:02:17.177 --> 00:02:22.549
"One hundred points!" Jackson said.

36
00:02:22.550 --> 00:02:25.097
The game buzzed.

37
00:02:25.098 --> 00:02:27.913
The tickets got jammed.

38
00:02:27.914 --> 00:02:32.630
Sanjay frowned.

39
00:02:32.631 --> 00:02:35.773
Later Mom picked up Harry.

40
00:02:35.774 --> 00:02:40.346
"How was the party?" she asked.

41
00:02:40.347 --> 00:02:44.281
"It was okay." Harry smiled.

42
00:02:44.282 --> 00:02:50.935
"My backyard party will be more fun!"
